# Normalise text files in the repository. Batch files are stored byte-for-byte with their CRLF line endings
# (no conversion at all), so they stay valid in every download path, including GitHub's "Download ZIP"
# (cmd.exe misparses .bat files with LF endings, e.g. goto labels).
* text=auto
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# binary assets
*.task binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
